Our Client

A creative technology agency that partners with leading brands to deliver digital experiences, marketing initiatives, and product design solutions. This opportunity supports one of their key accounts, where the Senior Production Designer will collaborate with multidisciplinary creative teams to produce high-quality marketing assets while leveraging AI tools throughout the creative process.

Job Summary

We're looking for a Senior Production Designer supporting a creative team, responsible for producing high-quality marketing assets while collaborating with multidisciplinary teams and incorporating AI tools into creative workflows to improve efficiency and experimentation.

Responsibilities

Produce high-quality marketing and production design assets;

Collaborate with designers, strategists, writers, and producers;

Work within existing design systems and brand guidelines;

Leverage AI tools (Claude and others) to streamline creative workflows;

Prepare production-ready deliverables with exceptional attention to detail;

Participate in creative reviews and iterations.

Qualifications and Job Requirements

Senior Production Design experience;

Adobe Creative Suite (especially Photoshop);

Advanced Figma;

Experience using Claude and AI tools in professional workflows.

Nice to have

Adobe Illustrator After Effects;

Motion graphics knowledge;

Experience in agency environments;

Experience with AI experimentation in creative environments.

